Obligations carried by this redistribution
------------------------------------------
- Keep both license texts (LICENSE, LICENSES/MIT.txt).
- Keep this NOTICE and the upstream attribution (repository URL, author, date).
- State what changed (below).
- Do not use the upstream project names or logos to suggest endorsement: Apache
  License 2.0 section 6 grants no trademark rights, and the upstream README
  states that MedXpert / SynomosAI / LGD are unregistered project identifiers.
- The wrapper code (package.json, cordis.patch.yml, lib/, test/) is released by
  this package under Apache-2.0.

Changes made by this package
----------------------------
- Added package.json, cordis.patch.yml, lib/index.js, test/smoke.mjs and README
  files so the collection can be installed as a DeepSeek Harness profile bundle.
- Skill files themselves are unmodified: frontmatter and body text are
  byte-identical to the upstream snapshot.
- No skill was renamed; directory names, `name:` values, descriptions and
  bodies keep their upstream form.
- No upstream binary asset (logo, icon, image) is redistributed.

